    "hero-ingredient-cards": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "ingredient-card-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Coconut_Oil_Extract.webp",
            "title": "Saponified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil",
            "title_size": "medium",
            "text": "<p><em>The base.<\/em> Cold-pressed virgin coconut oil reacted with food-grade lye produces true soap molecules and naturally occurring glycerin — a byproduct most commercial bars strip out and sell separately. Coconut soap is high in lauric and capric acid chains, naturally lathering and naturally antimicrobial. One fat. One reaction. No synthetic detergents added to do the work the soap already does.<\/p>",
            "button_label": ""
          }
        },
        "ingredient-card-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Spring_Water.webp",
            "title": "Naturally Lathering",
            "title_size": "medium",
            "text": "<p><em>Mechanism, not foam booster.<\/em> Coconut soap is naturally rich in lather because the lauric acid in cold-pressed virgin coconut oil produces a fluffy, generous lather without SLS, SLES, cocamidopropyl betaine, or any of the synthetic surfactants commercial bars use to fake the foaming experience. The lather here is the soap working — not a chemical sleight of hand.<\/p>",
            "button_label": ""
          }
        },
        "ingredient-card-3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Wax.webp",
            "title": "Variation Essential Oils",
            "title_size": "medium",
            "text": "<p><em>Scent without synthetic fragrance.<\/em> Each variation gets a different organic essential oil, named individually on the back panel — never a \"fragrance\" umbrella. Calming Lavender uses lavender oil. Nourishing Tea Tree uses tea tree oil. Refreshing Lemongrass uses lemongrass and tea tree oils. Pure Unscented has no oils added — just the natural light scent of saponified coconut oil.<\/p>",
            "button_label": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ingredient-card-1",
        "ingredient-card-2",
        "ingredient-card-3"
