    "founder-block": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "founder-heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "From The Founder",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "founder-body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We started reading bar soap labels the same way we read food labels — and what we found was rendered animal fat, synthetic detergents, EDTA, and \"fragrance\" hiding compounds nobody had to disclose.<\/p><p>We wanted a bar our family could use without thinking about it. One fat. Named essential oils. Nothing in the bar that wasn't earning its place. That's the line we drew, and we won't cross it for profit.<\/p><p>— Sean Fillmore<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
